**

# Docker builds only need package sources and their shared entrypoint. Keeping
# CAD, Git history, local toolchains, and generated artifacts out of the build
# context saves hundreds of megabytes per invocation.
!docker/
!docker/**
!ros1_ws/
!ros1_ws/src/
!ros1_ws/src/**
!ros2_ws/
!ros2_ws/src/
!ros2_ws/src/**
!tests/
!tests/fixtures/
!tests/fixtures/**
